**Handle missing resume metadata gracefully**  
`remove_resume(path)?` will error with ENODATA when no xattr was written—which is the common case for blobs smaller than 1 MiB because the write path only fires on 1 MiB boundaries. That turns a successful download into a failure. Guard the removal so you ignore `ErrorKind::NotFound` (or only call remove when you actually wrote metadata).  

