`open_without_migrations` does not enable WAL mode, while `open` does (line 37). This inconsistency could lead to different concurrency behavior depending on which method is used. If WAL mode is intended for all connections (for "better concurrent access" as mentioned in line 36), it should be enabled here as well, or the difference should be clearly documented.



