_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_

**Version updates applied to `packages.toml` for all packages even if only some installed successfully.**

`version_updates` is built from all `diff.to_install` entries (lines 225-233), but the guard on line 250 only checks whether *any* package installed. If package A installs successfully and package B fails, B's version still gets written to `packages.toml`, creating a version mismatch.

The same issue exists for `update_version_updates` in the update section (lines 265-301).


